OL,3,GNEWSAFootballer to help kids get their
OL,4,Akicks outdoor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe captain of a Premier League team
OL,7,Fhas launched a street football
OL,8,Fprogramme to encourage more children to
OL,9,Fenjoy outdoor play.
OL,11,FHull City defender Lewie Coyle said his
OL,12,Fcareer began by kicking a ball in an
OL,13,Falleyway near the East Hull home where
OL,14,Fhe grew up and he has called for more
OL,15,Fchildren to follow in his footsteps.
OL,17,FThe 31-year-old said: "I believe being
OL,18,Fallowed to lark (play) about outside
OL,19,Fgave me a head start in pursuing what
OL,20,Fmy career has turned out to be as a
OL,21,Fprofessional footballer."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
